  "expertText": "* = $1500\nOldDD00:\n.byte 0\nOldD018:\n.byte 0\nOldD016:\n.byte 0\nOldD011:\n.byte 0\n.macro BitmapOn\n    SEI\n    LDA $DD00\n    STA OldDD00\n    LDA $D018\n    STA OldD018\n    LDA $D016\n    STA OldD016\n    LDA $D011\n    STA OldD011\n    LDA $DD00\n    AND #%11111100\n    ORA #%00000011\n    STA $DD00\n    LDA #$18\n    STA $D018\n    LDA $D016\n    AND #%11101111\n    STA $D016\n    LDA $D011\n    ORA #%00100000\n    STA $D011\n    JSR HiresClearScreen\n    JSR ClearColorRam\n    CLI\n.endm\n.macro BitmapOff\n    SEI\n    LDA OldD016\n    STA $D016\n    LDA OldD018\n    STA $D018\n    LDA OldDD00\n    STA $DD00\n    LDA OldD011\n    STA $D011\n    CLI\n    LDA #$93\n    JSR $FFD2\n.endm\n.macro HiresClearScreen\n    LDX #$20\n    LDY #$00\n    LDA #$00\n    STA $FB\n    LDA #$20\n    STA $FC\n    LDA #$00\nHcsBmpPage:\n    STA ($FB),Y\n    INY\n    BNE HcsBmpPage\n    INC $FC\n    DEX\n    BNE HcsBmpPage\n    LDA #$00\n    LDX #$00\nHcsScreenBlock:\n    STA $0400,X\n    STA $0500,X\n    STA $0600,X\n    INX\n    BNE HcsScreenBlock\n    LDX #$00\nHcsScreenTail:\n    CPX #$E8\n    BEQ HcsDone\n    STA $0700,X\n    INX\n    BNE HcsScreenTail\nHcsDone:\n.endm\n.macro ClearColorRam\n    LDA #$00\n    LDX #$00\nCcrBlock:\n    STA $D800,X\n    STA $D900,X\n    STA $DA00,X\n    INX\n    BNE CcrBlock\n    LDX #$00\nCcrTail:\n    CPX #$E8\n    BEQ CcrDone\n    STA $DB00,X\n    INX\n    BNE CcrTail\nCcrDone:\n.endm\n.macro WaitForKey\n    CLI\nWaitKeyLoop:\n    JSR $FFE4\n    BEQ WaitKeyLoop\n    SEI\n.endm",
